BaseClaimPolicy::getFillExpiryBounds
├── given not initialized
│   └── it should return zeros
├── given initialized with STORAGE mode
│   ├── it should return correct bounds for configured chainId
│   ├── it should return zeros for unconfigured chainId
│   └── it should return correct bounds for multiple chainIds
├── given initialized with CATCHALL mode
│   └── it should return correct bounds for chainId 0
└── given storage isolation
    ├── it should isolate per configId
    └── it should isolate per account